  "conclusions": {
    "basic_data_interface": "Existing D+/D- and BOOT/RESET match the selected controller. No USB-UART bridge or external PHY addition justified by these three functions. Signal integrity and actual operation remain unverified.",
    "VBUS": "TinyUSB self_powered configuration is not the configuration of fixed-function Serial/JTAG. Missing VBUS sense alone does not prove flashing/CDC cannot function. Self-powered absence-of-VBUS signaling and physical attach/detach remain open; no USB compliance exemption inferred.",
    "charger": "Fixed ~109mA nominal charge branch has no MCU inhibit. Changing USB controller does not solve total input-current, enumeration or suspend conditions.",
    "firmware": "Existing mlx90393_sensor.ino reads one 0x0E device and uses Wire.begin(D1,D2); not accepted as final GPIO1/2 dual-MLX+IMU firmware. No firmware changed."
  },
